- vitest `packages/types/`, `packages/plugin-designer/` and `packages/i18n/`: `Test Files 356 passed (356)`, `Tests 6861 passed (6861)`.
- vitest over the 18 app-shell navigation, pins and sidebar files, `examples/schema-catalog/test/`, the two cli `validate` suites and the three spec-symbol script suites: `Test Files 57 passed (57)`, `Tests 2487 passed (2487)`.
- **Arm-list consumer sweep** for the mirror change. Every test that imports `NavigationItemSchema` or the app zod mirror, or runs `safeValidateSchema` / `StrictAnyComponentSchema` over an app or navigation document, was found by `git grep` and run with per-file verdicts: 34 files, 1251 tests, 0 failed. They include `zod-mirror-parity` 37/37, `navigation-spec-parity` 15/15, `imported-defaults-8317` 124/124, `nav-target-exclusivity-8563` 15/15, `navigation-model` 28/28, `zod-lazy-getter-identity-7918` 31/31, `page-nav-misc-spec-parity` 44/44, `handler-keys-json-refusal-6124` 336/336, the two app-shell studio-design nav suites 22/22 and 3/3, cli `validate-root-path-line` 6/6 and the catalog `tree-view-nodes-mirror-6939` 22/22.
